 and participated!","cat":"preseason","changes":null,"channel":"instagram","created":1794367441184,"date":"2026-11-11","hashtags":"#GSCG #ThePreseason #AllIn #GSCGDoHardThings #GSCGGrowth","log":[{"action":"created from template","at":1794367441184,"by":"Dylan","comment":"","role":"member"},{"action":"sent to review","at":1794375799192,"by":"Dylan","comment":"","role":"member"},{"action":"approved as director","at":1794375844460,"by":"Dylan","comment":"","role":"director"},{"action":"gave final approval","at":1794375853060,"by":"Dylan","comment":"","role":"advisor"},{"action":"scheduled for posting","at":1794375853060,"by":"Dylan","comment":"","role":"advisor"},{"action":"marked posted","at":1794714238158,"by":"Emma Fuller","comment":"","role":"member"}],"notes":"","owner":"Dylan","photoIds":["f33fc72d1663953a69f7ef0e7f6ba271.png","856582dbbc8d82d8e485bdb55af5667b.png","ae54c8128af1203a09a9f2b5eb26cccd.png","53a07646677aa8929d3cabbe4aceec79.png"],"postedAt":1794714238158,"results":{"url":""},"stage":"posted","time":"09:00","title":"Preseason Recap","type":"Recap","updated":1794376537275,"video":{"name":"Preseason_All_In_Kate_Gavin_George","pos":2,"size":28289863,"stillAuto":"frame","stillId":"92f28dda47a474c3b014ecdc580754da.jpg"}}},{"id":"mwbk1mv3amub","data":{"approvals":{"advisor":{"at":1794376513036,"by":"John Correia","role":"advisor"}},"caption":"The Preseason, GSCG\u0027s consultant training series, concluded on November 9.\n\nThis fall, Gonzaga Sport Consulting Group (GSCG) hosted The Preseason: three one-hour sessions for Gonzaga School of Business students, built around the skills our student consultants use on real projects with sports organizations. 41 different students took part across the series.\n\nThe three sessions:\n• Practice 1: Performance psychology and networking. Do hard things, handle pressure, and network with a plan.\n• Practice 2: Scope and research. Identify the real ask behind a client\u0027s request, test a hypothesis, and find the patterns in the evidence.\n• Practice 3: Recommending, slides and storytelling. Lead with the answer, support it with evidence, and present it clearly.\n\nWe are grateful to Dr. Rebecca Bull Schaefer, Professor of Management at the Gonzaga School of Business Administration, who joined Practice 3 to speak on the art of public speaking.\n\n14 students attended all three sessions. Congratulations to our All In students:\nAlex Yousoofian · Andrew Hebden · Ben Farrell · Bella Jasso · Daphne Van Wey · Evan Forthun · Gavin Kelly · George Giebel · Isabella Graham · Kate Webb · Mateo Sandoval · Nate Staudinger · Riley Burge · Ryder Brickman\n\nThank you to Dylan Hite, a Director of GSCG, for leading the series.\n\nTo learn more about GSCG or to work with our student consultants, follow along on this page.","cat":"preseason","changes":null,"channel":"linkedin","created":1794367441407,"date":"2026-11-11","hashtags":"#GSCG #ThePreseason #GonzagaSBA #SportsConsulting","log":[{"action":"created from template","at":1794367441407,"by":"Dylan","comment":"","role":"member"},{"action":"sent to review","at":1794375799455,"by":"Dylan","comment":"","role":"member"},{"action":"approved as director","at":1794375845258,"by":"Dylan","comment":"","role":"director"},{"action":"gave final approval","at":1794375854077,"by":"Dylan","comment":"","role":"advisor"},{"action":"scheduled for posting","at":1794375854077,"by":"Dylan","comment":"","role":"advisor"},{"action":"edited after approval, needs re-approval","at":1794376195083,"by":"Dylan Hite","comment":"","role":"director"},{"action":"sent to review","at":1794376195083,"by":"Dylan Hite","comment":"","role":"director"},{"action":"approved as director","at":1794376201749,"by":"Dylan Hite","comment":"","role":"director"},{"action":"requested changes","at":1794376216596,"by":"John Correia","comment":"blah","role":"advisor"},{"action":"resubmitted for review","at":1794376486687,"by":"Mateo Sandoval","comment":"","role":"member"},{"action":"gave final 